<%- include('../partials/header', {
    pageCss: '/css/pages/faqs.css?v=2'
}) %>

<!-- ============================================================
     HERO
============================================================ -->
<section class="page-hero" aria-labelledby="faqs-hero-title">

  <div class="page-hero-media" aria-hidden="true">
    <img
      src="/faqs-hero.webp"
      alt=""
      fetchpriority="high"
      decoding="async"
    >
  </div>

  <div class="page-hero-overlay" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="page-shell page-hero-inner">
    <div class="page-hero-copy">

      <nav class="page-breadcrumb page-enter" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
        <a href="/resources">Resources</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
        <span aria-current="page">FAQs</span>
      </nav>

      <h1
        id="faqs-hero-title"
        class="page-hero-title page-enter"
        style="--page-enter-delay: 120ms"
      >
        Frequently asked questions.
      </h1>

      <p
        class="page-hero-summary page-enter"
        style="--page-enter-delay: 240ms"
      >
        What you need to know about investing with STI Assets Management
        Limited.
      </p>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================================================
     TABS + ACCORDION
============================================================ -->
<section class="section faqs-section">

  <div class="faqs-shell">
    <div
      class="faqs-tabs"
      role="tablist"
      aria-label="Frequently asked question categories"
    >

      <button
        class="faqs-tab active"
        data-tab="general"
        role="tab"
        aria-selected="true"
      >
        General Info
      </button>

      <button
        class="faqs-tab"
        data-tab="services"
        role="tab"
        aria-selected="false"
      >
        Services &amp; Products
      </button>

      <button
        class="faqs-tab"
        data-tab="strategy"
        role="tab"
        aria-selected="false"
      >
        Strategy &amp; Risk
      </button>

      <button
        class="faqs-tab"
        data-tab="account"
        role="tab"
        aria-selected="false"
      >
        Account &amp; Operations
      </button>

    </div>

  <!-- TAB 1: GENERAL INFO -->
  <div class="faqs-panel active" data-panel="general">
    <div class="faq-item">
      <button class="faq-question">
        <span>What is asset management all about?</span>
        <span
  class="faq-icon"
  aria-hidden="true"
>
  <svg
    class="ui-icon"
    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
    fill="none"
    stroke="currentColor"
    stroke-width="1.75"
    stroke-linecap="round"
    stroke-linejoin="round"
    focusable="false"
  >
    <path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path>
  </svg>
</span>
      </button>
      <div class="faq-answer">
        <p>Asset management involves the professional management of investments and assets on behalf of individuals, institutions, or organizations. It aims to maximize returns while managing risk.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <button class="faq-question">
        <span>Are you registered with the SEC?</span>
        <span
          class="faq-icon"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <svg
            class="ui-icon"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="1.75"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            focusable="false"
          >
            <path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path>
          </svg>
        </span>
      </button>
      <div class="faq-answer">
        <p>Yes, we are licensed by the Securities and Exchange Commission as a Fund/Portfolio Manager.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <button class="faq-question">
        <span>Why should I consider professional asset management?</span>
        <span
  class="faq-icon"
  aria-hidden="true"
>
  <svg
    class="ui-icon"
    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
    fill="none"
    stroke="currentColor"
    stroke-width="1.75"
    stroke-linecap="round"
    stroke-linejoin="round"
    focusable="false"
  >
    <path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path>
  </svg>
</span>
      </button>
      <div class="faq-answer">
        <p>Professional asset managers have expertise in selecting and managing investments, which can lead to better returns and risk management compared to individual efforts.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <button class="faq-question">
        <span>What sets your asset management services apart from others?</span>
        <span
  class="faq-icon"
  aria-hidden="true"
>
  <svg
    class="ui-icon"
    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
    fill="none"
    stroke="currentColor"
    stroke-width="1.75"
    stroke-linecap="round"
    stroke-linejoin="round"
    focusable="false"
  >
    <path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path>
  </svg>
</span>
      </button>
      <div class="faq-answer">
        <p>Our company prides itself on personalized service, a team of experienced professionals, and a commitment to aligning your investments with your specific financial goals.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- TAB 2: SERVICES & PRODUCTS -->
  <div class="faqs-panel" data-panel="services">
    <div class="faq-item">
      <button class="faq-question">
        <span>What investment services does STIAM offer?</span>
        <span
  class="faq-icon"
  aria-hidden="true"
>
  <svg
    class="ui-icon"
    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
    fill="none"
    stroke="currentColor"
    stroke-width="1.75"
    stroke-linecap="round"
    stroke-linejoin="round"
    focusable="false"
  >
    <path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path>
  </svg>
</span>
      </button>
      <div class="faq-answer">
        <p>We offer our expertise in Financial advisory, Market Research, Portfolio &amp; funds management, and corporate investment schemes.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <button class="faq-question">
        <span>What are your current product offerings?</span>
        <span
  class="faq-icon"
  aria-hidden="true"
>
  <svg
    class="ui-icon"
    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
    fill="none"
    stroke="currentColor"
    stroke-width="1.75"
    stroke-linecap="round"
    stroke-linejoin="round"
    focusable="false"
  >
    <path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path>
  </svg>
</span>
      </button>
      <div class="faq-answer">
        <p>As a capital market operator, we hold and manage our clients' investments under our SEC-approved products namely STIAM money market note, STIAM fixed-income note, and STIAM fixed-income dollar note. Please check the product section of our website for more details.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <button class="faq-question">
        <span>What types of assets do you manage?</span>
        <span
  class="faq-icon"
  aria-hidden="true"
>
  <svg
    class="ui-icon"
    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
    fill="none"
    stroke="currentColor"
    stroke-width="1.75"
    stroke-linecap="round"
    stroke-linejoin="round"
    focusable="false"
  >
    <path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path>
  </svg>
</span>
      </button>
      <div class="faq-answer">
        <p>We manage a wide range of assets, including money market securities, bonds, stocks, real estate, and alternative investments, tailored to your investment objectives.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <button class="faq-question">
        <span>Is there a minimum investment requirement to use your products or strategy?</span>
        <span
  class="faq-icon"
  aria-hidden="true"
>
  <svg
    class="ui-icon"
    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
    fill="none"
    stroke="currentColor"
    stroke-width="1.75"
    stroke-linecap="round"
    stroke-linejoin="round"
    focusable="false"
  >
    <path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path>
  </svg>
</span>
      </button>
      <div class="faq-answer">
        <p>Yes, we have minimum investment requirements. These requirements vary depending on the specific product or strategy you are interested in. Please refer to our products section for further information.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- TAB 3: STRATEGY & RISK -->
  <div class="faqs-panel" data-panel="strategy">
    <div class="faq-item">
      <button class="faq-question">
        <span>How does the asset management process work?</span>
        <span
  class="faq-icon"
  aria-hidden="true"
>
  <svg
    class="ui-icon"
    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
    fill="none"
    stroke="currentColor"
    stroke-width="1.75"
    stroke-linecap="round"
    stroke-linejoin="round"
    focusable="false"
  >
    <path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path>
  </svg>
</span>
      </button>
      <div class="faq-answer">
        <p>Our asset management process begins with a thorough analysis of your financial goals and risk tolerance. We then create a customized investment strategy, implement it, monitor your portfolio, and make adjustments as needed.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <button class="faq-question">
        <span>How do you determine my risk tolerance?</span>
        <span
  class="faq-icon"
  aria-hidden="true"
>
  <svg
    class="ui-icon"
    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
    fill="none"
    stroke="currentColor"
    stroke-width="1.75"
    stroke-linecap="round"
    stroke-linejoin="round"
    focusable="false"
  >
    <path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path>
  </svg>
</span>
      </button>
      <div class="faq-answer">
        <p>We assess your risk tolerance through a comprehensive questionnaire and discussions about your financial situation, goals, and investment horizon.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <button class="faq-question">
        <span>What is your investment philosophy?</span>
        <span
  class="faq-icon"
  aria-hidden="true"
>
  <svg
    class="ui-icon"
    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
    fill="none"
    stroke="currentColor"
    stroke-width="1.75"
    stroke-linecap="round"
    stroke-linejoin="round"
    focusable="false"
  >
    <path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path>
  </svg>
</span>
      </button>
      <div class="faq-answer">
        <p>Our diversified alpha-seeking value investing philosophy stands as a beacon of disciplined, research-driven, and risk-aware investment. We are committed to delivering superior returns while safeguarding our clients' capital. Through the marriage of proactive alpha generation, value-focused strategies, and robust risk management, we seek to navigate the ever-evolving financial landscape to achieve financial prosperity for our clients.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <button class="faq-question">
        <span>How does the asset management process work, and what is your approach to handling market volatility and downturns?</span>
        <span
  class="faq-icon"
  aria-hidden="true"
>
  <svg
    class="ui-icon"
    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
    fill="none"
    stroke="currentColor"
    stroke-width="1.75"
    stroke-linecap="round"
    stroke-linejoin="round"
    focusable="false"
  >
    <path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path>
  </svg>
</span>
      </button>
      <div class="faq-answer">
        <p>Our approach involves diversification of funds and investment vehicles, dollar-cost averaging, constantly reviewing investment goals, and engaging appropriate risk management techniques.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <button class="faq-question">
        <span>Can you customize my investment portfolio?</span>
        <span
  class="faq-icon"
  aria-hidden="true"
>
  <svg
    class="ui-icon"
    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
    fill="none"
    stroke="currentColor"
    stroke-width="1.75"
    stroke-linecap="round"
    stroke-linejoin="round"
    focusable="false"
  >
    <path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path>
  </svg>
</span>
      </button>
      <div class="faq-answer">
        <p>We tailor your investment portfolio through a personalized financial planning process, combining different asset classes. We regularly rebalance portfolios to align with your financial plan in sync with your life circumstances; we update your plan and suggest portfolio adjustments to ensure adequate allocation.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

